{"title":"2013 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Three positive integers are each greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, have a product of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/6/8d675b0de9ac46b8d4d3d8fe2b89ceecdb09e6d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$27000$\" width=\"44\" height=\"12\" />, and are pairwise relatively prime. What is their sum?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/f/66fb687f4896312c740f3caded1f47b0e08938e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 100\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 137\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 156\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 160\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 165$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"439\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The prime factorization of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/6/8d675b0de9ac46b8d4d3d8fe2b89ceecdb09e6d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$27000$\" width=\"44\" height=\"12\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/1/b6142a18de97a2fed24192b1e16c944ddd6a0449.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^3*3^3*5^3$\" width=\"82\" height=\"15\" />. These three factors are pairwise relatively prime, so the sum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/c/9ece22addfc746a8233cb57605637ff7e7f8d4f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^3+3^3+5^3=8+27+125=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"236\" height=\"16\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/5/1e5d12db3acdc1a9d07f3e2f96632651505cb575.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D) }160}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"75\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10B\" title=\"2013 AMC 10B\">2013 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2013 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2013 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_8\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2013 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2013 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2013 AMC 10B Proble